message: "If you reference this project, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "DLSS5 FOR PS5"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Swervegod1"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-09-12
url: "https://github.com/Swervegod1/dlss5-for-ps5"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Swervegod1/dlss5-for-ps5"
abstract: >-
  DLSS5 FOR PS5 is an unofficial PC-side PS5 Remote Play and capture-card
  video enhancer using WebGL 2 spatial upscaling, sharpening, contrast
  controls, and before/after comparison. It is not NVIDIA DLSS 5, Sony PSSR,
  or native PS5 software.
keywords:
  - PS5 Remote Play
  - PS5 video enhancer
  - video upscaling
  - capture card
  - WebGL 2
  - GLSL
  - video sharpening
